    "promptBasis": "editorial restaurant photography, soft window side light, late morning, warm 3800K, open soft shadows, 45-degree table angle, cropped at the plate edge, staff hands allowed in frame, kraft paper, wok, enamel bowl, chopsticks, light airy palette, natural imperfections, real restaurant setting, 35mm film look, no text, no people facing camera",
